  "把棒球里的投打判断，做成两个人的桌面对抗。": "Turning baseball’s pitching decisions into a two-player tabletop contest.",
  "我喜欢棒球里上一球失误后，下一球还能重新判断的过程。Money Ball 把投球、挥棒和守备拆成桌面步骤：玩家看见投手的标记，猜测尚未公开的球种，再决定要不要挥棒。球员卡采用我的校队队友形象；我在这个项目中投入最多的是机制设计与卡牌构筑。": "What I love about baseball is the chance to reassess after a missed pitch. Money Ball breaks pitching, batting and fielding into tabletop steps: read the pitcher’s mark, predict the hidden pitch type, then decide whether to swing. The player cards feature my university teammates. My main focus was designing the mechanics and card system.",
