  "当前状态": "Current state",
  "左下记录好球、坏球和出局数；右侧放公开事件卡。达到第三好球、第四坏球或第三出局时，触发相应结算。": "The lower left tracks strikes, balls and outs; the right holds public event cards. The third strike, fourth ball or third out triggers the corresponding result.",
  "这一球，另用格子卡来判断": "Each pitch is resolved on a separate grid",
