  "开局先排好九名首发、一名替补，确定棒次与守备位置。下面按玩家实际操作的先后顺序，说明一次投打怎样进行。": "Start with nine starters and one substitute, setting the batting order and fielding positions. The following steps show a pitch in the order players actually take them.",
  "打席开始：公开临时条件": "Start the plate appearance: reveal temporary conditions",
  "每个打席抽两张事件卡，选一张公开。辅助卡也在画格子前公开，用后移出。双方先知道当前条件，再进入投打。": "Draw two event cards and reveal one. Support cards are also revealed before drawing on the grid and removed after use. Both players know the conditions before the pitch.",
  "一个打席，指同一名打者连续面对投球，直到出局或上垒的这一段。": "A plate appearance covers one batter’s consecutive pitches until they reach base or are put out.",
  "防守方：暗选球种，亮出起始标记": "Defense: hide the pitch type, reveal the starting mark",
  "投手扣住球种卡，在格子卡上画出并展示起始标记。打者此时看得到位置线索，还不知道球种。": "The pitcher keeps the pitch card face down and displays a starting mark on the grid. The batter can see the positional clue, but not the pitch type.",
  "进攻方：决定是否挥棒、覆盖哪里": "Offense: decide whether to swing and where to cover",
  "打者可以打击、触击或选球。“选球”就是不挥棒；普通挥棒最多画三个相连格子。覆盖的位置，是对最终落点的预测。": "The batter may swing, bunt or take the pitch. A normal swing covers up to three connected cells. This area predicts the final pitch location.",
  "双方揭牌：先算落点，再判断结果": "Reveal: determine the location, then resolve the result",
  "按球种与技能确定最终落点，随后判断打击有没有碰到来球。": "Apply the pitch type and abilities to find the final location, then check whether the swing connects.",
  "好坏球也是在这一步产生的。": "Strikes and balls are determined at this step too.",
  "挥棒且击中": "Swing and connect",
  "普通击中 → 守备判定；一格命中 → 直接全垒打，该打者得 1 分。": "Normal contact → fielding check; single-cell contact → automatic home run, scoring one run for the batter.",
  "挥棒但没击中": "Swing and miss",
  "无论落点在框内还是框外，都记 1 次好球。": "One strike, whether the pitch ends inside or outside the zone.",
  "不挥棒": "Take the pitch",
  "最终落点在好球区内 → 记好球；在好球区外 → 记坏球。": "Final location inside the strike zone → strike; outside → ball.",
  "把结果记回图板，再决定下一步": "Update the board and decide what happens next",
  "击中后的守备结果决定出局或安打；安打按对应规则推进跑者。没有结束打席时，擦掉本球标记，重复第 02–04 步继续投球。": "After contact, fielding determines an out or a hit; hits advance runners under the relevant rules. If the plate appearance continues, erase the marks and repeat steps 02–04.",
  "什么时候换打者、换边、结束比赛？": "When do the batter, sides and game change?",
  "3 好球 → 三振出局；4 坏球 → 保送上一垒。": "3 strikes → strikeout; 4 balls → walk to first base.",
  "击球被成功守备也会出局。当前打者结束打席，按棒次换下一名打者，好坏球重新累计。": "A successful fielding check also puts the batter out. Move to the next batter in the order and reset the ball and strike count.",
  "3 名打者出局 → 交换攻守。": "3 outs → switch offense and defense.",
  "双方各进攻一次，才算完成一局。图板上的垒包用于追踪进攻方跑者的推进。": "An inning ends after both teams have batted. The board’s bases track runners’ progress.",
  "最后三局结束 → 比较得分。": "After the final three innings → compare scores.",
  "普通安打靠队友接续推进得分；一格命中的全垒打，让该打者直接得分。": "Normal hits rely on teammates to keep advancing runners; a single-cell home run scores the batter immediately.",
  "投打规则下，不同玩家的选择": "Different players, different pitching decisions",
  "起始标记公开，球种仍隐藏。同一条线索可以有不同答案，打者需要先决定，再接受揭牌结果。": "The starting mark is public; the pitch type stays hidden. One clue can lead to several outcomes, so the batter must commit before the reveal.",
