  "再一次好球就三振，再一次坏球就保送。投手展示好球区下沿的标记：球可能留在框内，也可能移到框外。": "One more strike means a strikeout; one more ball means a walk. The pitcher reveals a mark along the zone’s lower edge: the pitch may stay inside or move outside.",
  "：框外球带来保送，框内球却让打者三振。": ": an outside pitch earns a walk, but an inside pitch causes a strikeout.",
