  "：猜中落点有机会击出；猜错即使落在框外，也会因挥空而三振。": ": predict correctly for a chance to hit; miss and strike out, even if the pitch ends outside the zone.",
  "我希望前几球留下的经验能进入下一次判断。球数改变了失败的代价，同一个标记就不再只有一种应对。": "I want experience from previous pitches to inform the next decision. The count changes the cost of failure, so the same mark invites a different response.",
  "好坏球的判定图": "Strike & ball decision diagram",
  "图解 D · 好坏球在揭牌得到最终落点后结算": "Diagram D · Call the strike or ball after revealing the final pitch location",
