  "球员卡提供不同的位置、守备力和技能。把谁放在哪里，会改变普通击球之后能否安全上垒。": "Player cards provide different positions, fielding ratings and abilities. Who plays where affects whether normal contact lets the batter reach base safely.",
  "一格命中直接全垒打。其余普通击中，需要先按击球方向和击球卡规则，找到相应守备球员；每名相关球员掷六面骰，": "Single-cell contact is an automatic home run. For other contact, use the hit direction and batting card to identify the relevant fielders. Each rolls a six-sided die: ",
