  "约 90": "Approx. 90",
  "分钟": "minutes",
  "当前 / 最后三局": "Current version / Final three innings",
  "我把故事放到 Game 7 第七局，让玩家直接进入决胜阶段。逐球试探仍然保留，减少的是整场重复操作的次数。代价是长线轮换空间变小，所以当前保留一名替补。": "Starting in the seventh inning of Game 7 brings players straight to the decisive stretch. Pitch-by-pitch probing remains, with fewer repeated actions across the match. The tradeoff is less room for long-term rotation, so the current version keeps one substitute.",
  "另一项取舍是没有加入左投对左打的额外克制加成。左右手仍是角色特点，玩家不必先记住这类关系，才能参与标记、球种与覆盖范围的判断。": "I also omitted an extra advantage for left-handed pitching against left-handed batting. Handedness remains a character trait, but players need not memorize matchups before making predictions about marks, pitches and coverage.",
  "卡牌UI": "Card UI",
  "我独立完成机制、卡牌内容、规则、美术与印刷。制作实体时，先区分卡片用途，再组织正面的具体效果。": "I created the mechanics, card content, rules, art and print production independently. For the physical cards, I first separated their functions, then organized their effects on the fronts.",
  "棒球符号 → 球种卡": "Baseball symbol → Pitch cards",
  "暗选球路，揭牌时确定变化。": "Select a hidden trajectory; reveal its change later.",
  "球棒符号 → 击球卡": "Bat symbol → Batting cards",
  "选择打击、触击或选球。": "Choose to swing, bunt or take.",
  "黄底感叹号 → 事件卡": "Yellow exclamation mark → Event cards",
  "打席开始时公开的临时条件。": "Temporary conditions revealed at the start of a plate appearance.",
  "卡牌 UI · 将能力、位置与技能说明对应到卡面": "Card UI · Connect ratings, positions and ability descriptions to the card layout",
  "卡背负责让玩家在整理、取牌时分清用途；正面再解释效果。事件卡先公开，双方才知道这一打席有什么变化，然后进入投打选择。": "Card backs distinguish functions during sorting and drawing; fronts explain effects. Event cards are revealed first so both players understand the conditions before making pitching and batting choices.",
  "让校队经历落在具体人物上": "Bring team experience into individual characters",
  "球员卡保留队友的照片、姓名、位置与能力；经理卡以球队经理为原型，延续球队标志。它们让这套原型与我的棒球经历保持联系。": "Player cards retain teammates’ photographs, names, positions and abilities. Manager cards draw on our team managers and retain the team emblem, connecting the prototype to my baseball experience.",
  "经理卡与封面盒": "Manager cards & cover box",
  "经理卡 · 不同人物与回合技能": "Manager cards · Different characters and turn abilities",
  "封面盒 · 手工制作的实体原型": "Cover box · Handmade physical prototype",
  "测试": "Playtesting",
  "四轮当面双人测试，参与者分别有不同的棒球知识和桌游经验。": "Four rounds of face-to-face, two-player testing with different levels of baseball knowledge and board game experience.",
