  "Absolutely Games · 制作人": "Absolutely Games · Producer",
  "为工作室原创动作游戏 Rewinder 获得投资，推进项目制作。": "Secured investment for Rewinder, the studio’s original action game, and oversee its production.",
  "网易雷火 · 祝融工作室": "NetEase ThunderFire · Zhurong Studio",
  "担任战斗策划，负责《虹猫蓝兔七侠传》IP 联动双分支终结技能的设计与实现，涵盖机制、数值平衡与表现。与美术、程序协作推进功能上线，并优化击退与赛季饰品的战斗反馈。": "Combat designer for a two-branch finishing ability in the Hongmao Lantu Qixia Zhuan crossover, covering mechanics, balancing, implementation and presentation. Collaborated with artists and programmers to ship the feature and refined knockback and seasonal-accessory combat feedback.",
